1
00:01:17,519 --> 00:01:18,359
Jiaojiao,

2
00:01:19,319 --> 00:01:21,480
are you willing to forgive me?

3
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,280
I'm not.

4
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:41,599
Jiaojiao,

5
00:01:43,719 --> 00:01:45,159
I've caused you

6
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,719
and the family too much trouble.

7
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:49,319
I know I was wrong.

8
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:51,959
I used to think

9
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,640
you wanted to take over

10
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,480
for yourself.

11
00:01:56,959 --> 00:01:57,920
But now I see

12
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:01,079
you've been doing it for the Su family.

13
00:02:03,319 --> 00:02:04,079
I thought

14
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,359
I was capable of being the head.

15
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,280
But now I know

16
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:11,159
I don't deserve it.

17
00:02:13,719 --> 00:02:15,000
I was wrong.

18
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,759
I'll change myself.

19
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,599
I'll listen to you

20
00:02:20,479 --> 00:02:21,759
and you alone.

21
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:22,840
I won't complain.

22
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,520
Please forgive me.

23
00:02:54,759 --> 00:02:55,479
Uncle,

24
00:02:58,199 --> 00:02:59,919
although we always quarrel,

25
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:03,560
I've never hated you.

26
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:06,560
I'm sorry.

27
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,879
As long as you have the Su family in your heart,

28
00:03:12,479 --> 00:03:13,400
we will always

29
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:15,520
be a family.

30
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:31,560
Zhen,

31
00:03:33,719 --> 00:03:36,039
although the Escort Agency has suffered,

32
00:03:37,479 --> 00:03:38,960
but the children

33
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:42,159
are finally united.

34
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,159
Father,

35
00:04:04,719 --> 00:04:05,919
have you decided on the finale

36
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,840
for the royal speech contest?

37
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,719
It should be Cheng Qi

38
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:10,680
or Ling Feng.

39
00:04:11,479 --> 00:04:12,240
Should?

40
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,520
Or?

41
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:19,560
Are you planning to tell the royals

42
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,439
like this in a few days?

43
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:24,399
I was set to marry Cheng Qi,

44
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:27,040
but my brother sent urgent messengers

45
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,839
to arrange for Ling Feng.

46
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:31,759
Where's the letter?

47
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,319
In that case,

48
00:04:51,279 --> 00:04:52,879
let's do as Qijia said.

49
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:55,439
If we arrange for Ling Feng,

50
00:04:58,079 --> 00:04:59,639
we might be questioned by the royal family.

51
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:03,079
Then find a way to get him through.

52
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:04,279
Do I need to teach you

53
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,000
do you need me to teach you?

54
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:08,519
Yes,

55
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:09,639
I'll take care of it right away.

56
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,040
Dad,

57
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:18,560
I've secured deals

58
00:05:18,879 --> 00:05:20,480
with several major merchants in Yunjing.

59
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,079
Our business in the city

60
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:23,879
will be all ours from now on.

61
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:27,839
But don't get too excited just yet.

62
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:30,399
Colluding with bandits is a serious crime.

63
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:31,639
Zhang Xi Yun

64
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:33,480
wants to pin this charge on the Su family.

65
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,160
It's not foolproof.

66
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:37,680
If

67
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,519
Su Yuejiao comes out

68
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:41,160
and makes some trouble,

69
00:05:41,839 --> 00:05:42,639
we may lose

70
00:05:42,879 --> 00:05:44,959
the business.

71
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,040
Dad

72
00:05:46,639 --> 00:05:47,800
Even if she doesn't go to jail,

73
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:50,519
just the suspicion of collusion with bandits,

74
00:05:50,839 --> 00:05:51,839
her escort agency

75
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,600
can't run well in the future.

76
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,240
Your kick wasn't hard enough.

77
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:01,519
If you could have killed her on the spot,

78
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:02,319
the Su family

79
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:03,800
would be completely finished.

80
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:05,920
Don't worry, dad.

81
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:08,079
We'll have plenty of opportunities in the future.

82
00:06:14,839 --> 00:06:16,399
Divorce with Su Yuejiao.

83
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,199
Be my guest.

84
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:21,959
I'm just an ordinary man

85
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,000
with little talent and knowledge.

86
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:25,360
I never thought I could be your confidant.

87
00:06:27,199 --> 00:06:29,279
You said you were not talented.

88
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,720
Do you think the Yun State is without talent,

89
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:34,279
or the Starry Cloud Conference is a joke?

90
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:37,319
I thought you wanted to protect the Su's Escort Agency.

91
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:41,879
It's indeed

92
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,920
your arrangement.

93
00:06:44,759 --> 00:06:46,000
I just made the arrangement.

94
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,680
But now,

95
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:49,839
the one who decides their fate

96
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,759
is you.

97
00:06:55,879 --> 00:06:57,519
So if I divorce,

98
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:58,920
you'll

99
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,560
save the agency?

100
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,079
You seem

101
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,120
to have no leverage to negotiate with me.

102
00:07:13,319 --> 00:07:15,160
If you don't want to marry me, that's fine.

103
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,079
But if you want to save the agency,

104
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:20,120
you must give up the title of Xingyun Champion.

105
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,759
and let Mr. Ling take it.

106
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:26,079
The title was

107
00:07:26,279 --> 00:07:27,639
given by you.

108
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,399
If you want to take it back,

109
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,800
I have no objection.

110
00:07:30,959 --> 00:07:31,639
Hold on.

111
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,000
I haven't finished.

112
00:07:55,759 --> 00:07:56,920
Whether it's the poetry recital

113
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,040
or the poetry anthology,

114
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:59,439
as long as you write it,

115
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:02,879
people will think it's your work.

116
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,120
The literary world of the Yun State

117
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,879
will no longer have a place for Cheng Qi.

118
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,680
A nameless bumpkin like you,

119
00:08:18,759 --> 00:08:19,800
do you even understand what elegance is?

120
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,639
Cheng Qi?

121
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:24,000
Never heard of him.

122
00:08:24,319 --> 00:08:26,839
Probably some poor scholar from some remote village.

123
00:08:30,079 --> 00:08:32,559
If I can win the competition and gain recognition,

124
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,039
I can change this trend.

125
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:36,080
I am the rule.

126
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,159
My book

127
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,039
[my books,]

128
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,519
[and make them accessible to all.]

129
00:08:46,759 --> 00:08:47,799
[Let goodness take root,]

130
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,639
[and help our nation,]

131
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,240
[our literary circle,]

132
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,360
[prosper and thrive.]

133
00:08:52,519 --> 00:08:53,799
[And let there be no more Cheng Qi.]

134
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,279
Of course,

135
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:29,399
a divorce is also necessary.

136
00:09:29,879 --> 00:09:31,440
As long as you can move into this villa,

137
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:38,600
the Su family will

138
00:09:39,279 --> 00:09:42,279
the Sus will be safe.

139
00:09:50,159 --> 00:09:50,840
Ms. Zhang,

140
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:52,759
this is a big deal.

141
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,240
Can I have a few days to think about it?

142
00:09:55,879 --> 00:09:56,759
Of course.

143
00:10:40,679 --> 00:10:41,159
See?

144
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,440
I told you there would be delicious food.

145
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,120
You lost.

146
00:10:48,679 --> 00:10:49,240
Grandpa,

147
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,799
this is the sweet cake and braised pork for you.

148
00:10:56,159 --> 00:10:56,759
Jiao,

149
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,320
this is the pig's trotter soup I bought for you.

150
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,519
Drink it while it's hot.

151
00:11:02,159 --> 00:11:03,799
What did Zhang Xi Yun want from you?

152
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:07,080
She didn't just ask you to bring food, did she?

153
00:11:09,519 --> 00:11:10,600
The matter of the Escort Agency

154
00:11:10,879 --> 00:11:12,360
should be resolved soon.

155
00:11:13,639 --> 00:11:14,360
Really?

156
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:17,919
My brother-in-law,

157
00:11:18,559 --> 00:11:19,519
you're really something.

158
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,440
I really underestimated you before.

159
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:24,879
Thanks.

160
00:11:30,639 --> 00:11:32,159
Did you promise her something?

161
00:11:34,639 --> 00:11:35,919
It was just a misunderstanding.

162
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,879
Once explained, it's all good.

163
00:11:43,279 --> 00:11:43,759
Grandpa,

164
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,240
I have a favor to ask.

165
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,720
Your business is our business.

166
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:50,320
Go ahead.

167
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,799
Although we're still under lockdown,

168
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:55,120
the day after tomorrow

169
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:57,080
is the day for Jiao to take over.

170
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,879
I think it's not necessary to postpone it.

171
00:12:00,159 --> 00:12:01,200
How about holding it as usual?

172
00:12:05,279 --> 00:12:06,759
But now we can't get out.

173
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,600
What about the things needed for the ceremony?

174
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:12,080
You can leave the clothes to me.

175
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,360
Even if I don't sleep,

176
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,879
I can make it in time.

177
00:12:15,519 --> 00:12:16,399
As for the incense table,

178
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:17,360
I've already prepared it.

179
00:12:17,759 --> 00:12:18,720
It's not appropriate for you to do so.

180
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:19,919
It seems

181
00:12:20,039 --> 00:12:21,519
I don't want My Lady to take over.

182
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:23,919
Well,

183
00:12:24,559 --> 00:12:26,159
I have some new family emblems.

184
00:12:27,159 --> 00:12:28,320
You can use them.

185
00:12:30,879 --> 00:12:31,480
I...

186
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:32,879
Then I...

187
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:35,080
You can be in charge of the process.

188
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:37,240
It's okay to make the rest simple.

189
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,399
No.

190
00:12:42,519 --> 00:12:44,600
It's a big deal for the Su family.

191
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:47,120
It can't be taken lightly.

192
00:12:50,399 --> 00:12:52,639
Luckily, I was prepared.

193
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:53,720
It's in

194
00:12:54,399 --> 00:12:56,360
the room for miscellaneous items.

195
00:13:00,159 --> 00:13:01,639
Grandpa is so thoughtful.

196
00:13:18,399 --> 00:13:19,320
Are you asleep?

197
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:22,759
No.

198
00:13:24,519 --> 00:13:25,480
I can't sleep.

199
00:13:26,559 --> 00:13:27,879
Is your wound hurting again?

200
00:13:29,559 --> 00:13:30,120
No.

201
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:33,879
It's just that when I think about getting a handprint,

202
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,480
it seems unreal.

203
00:13:40,159 --> 00:13:40,960
Are you happy?

204
00:13:43,519 --> 00:13:44,200
Yes.

205
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,039
Gao Jiao

206
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:51,559
What are you going to do

207
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,000
after the handprint ceremony?

208
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,840
I'll take care of the Escort Agency.

209
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:03,679
I wasn't sure before.

210
00:14:04,559 --> 00:14:05,519
But now I have you.

211
00:14:06,519 --> 00:14:07,559
I feel at ease.

212
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:14,399
Silly.

213
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,519
The Escort Agency will be better and better.

214
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:24,320
It will be better and better.

215
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:29,480
Go to sleep.

216
00:16:29,799 --> 00:16:30,480
No,

217
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:31,960
I have to find him.

218
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,360
Your master is fine.

219
00:16:33,879 --> 00:16:34,960
He came out a few days ago

220
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,480
and even visited the Grand Preceptor's villa.

221
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,960
Do you know why he didn't tell me?

222
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,679
Why didn't he come to find me?

223
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:45,240
You never seem to care about me like this.

224
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,200
It's different.

225
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,200
Yeah.

226
00:16:49,679 --> 00:16:51,519
I'm different

227
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:52,600
from your master.

228
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,600
You know I don't mean that.

229
00:16:56,399 --> 00:16:57,080
Master.

230
00:16:58,799 --> 00:17:00,240
Speak of the devil.

231
00:17:01,039 --> 00:17:01,519
Miss Meng.

232
00:17:02,159 --> 00:17:03,399
Can I borrow some money?

233
00:17:06,039 --> 00:17:06,559
Go ahead.

234
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:07,920
Thank you.

235
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:09,359
My Lord.

236
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:10,920
Yicheng, come here.

237
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:14,200
This is all the money I have left.

238
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:14,960
Take it.

239
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:15,759
My Lord,

240
00:17:16,119 --> 00:17:17,119
what do you mean?

241
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:19,119
I'm leaving the Escort Agency

242
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,440
and moving to the Prime Minister's garden.

243
00:17:21,119 --> 00:17:22,720
If you want to stay in the Imperial City,

244
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:23,920
you can use the money

245
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:25,519
to propose to Miss Meng.

246
00:17:28,839 --> 00:17:29,319
My Lord,

247
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:30,319
I have to follow you.

248
00:17:30,759 --> 00:17:32,200
You can help me when you are outside.

249
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,480
Miss Meng is a good person.

250
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:38,039
She is a softie.

251
00:17:38,519 --> 00:17:39,720
She won't treat you badly.

252
00:17:40,759 --> 00:17:41,559
As for my father,

253
00:17:42,799 --> 00:17:44,039
if he blames you,

254
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,559
just say I sold you out.

255
00:17:46,319 --> 00:17:47,359
He won't make it hard for you.

256
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:49,079
My Lord,

257
00:17:49,839 --> 00:17:51,039
you have more expenses than I do.

258
00:18:20,279 --> 00:18:22,960
Have you made up your mind?

259
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,759
I've left the Escort Agency.

260
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:26,519
I'm willing to write for Mr. Ling.

261
00:18:27,519 --> 00:18:29,319
Please let the Sus off the hook.

262
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:33,480
Do you care so much about Su Yuejiao?

263
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,079
Never mind.

264
00:18:39,799 --> 00:18:40,720
I made the terms.

265
00:18:41,039 --> 00:18:42,079
You're here.

266
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:43,599
I'll keep my promise.

267
00:18:44,599 --> 00:18:45,319
But

268
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,839
if anything goes wrong at the speech contest,

269
00:18:49,519 --> 00:18:51,440
I'll make sure to take care of your agency.

270
00:18:53,079 --> 00:18:53,920
Take him away.

271
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:03,240
Look at his attitude.

272
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:04,920
Why not just let the government

273
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,119
punish the Sus?

274
00:19:07,119 --> 00:19:09,480
I can use the Sus as long as he's on my side.

275
00:19:11,319 --> 00:19:12,480
The speech contest is coming.

276
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,319
We should put the big picture first.

277
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:15,640
Besides,

278
00:19:16,519 --> 00:19:18,720
I don't want a zombie in the future.

279
00:19:19,519 --> 00:19:20,799
I don't understand

280
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:23,200
what's so good about Cheng Qi.

281
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:25,920
You've been so devoted to him.

282
00:19:27,119 --> 00:19:28,640
He would sacrifice something

283
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:30,400
more important than his life for the one he loves.

284
00:19:31,119 --> 00:19:32,880
How many men in the world can do that?

285
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,960
When he lives here for a long time,

286
00:19:37,519 --> 00:19:38,240
he will

287
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,519
naturally treat me as his family,

288
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:41,720
cherish me,

289
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:42,799
and love me.

290
00:19:53,279 --> 00:19:54,880
The food is getting cold.

291
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:56,839
Is my son-in-law coming back or not?

292
00:19:57,160 --> 00:19:57,960
He must be drinking.

293
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:01,119
Where is

294
00:20:01,119 --> 00:20:02,519
Qi?

295
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:06,480
He must be telling Tang Xin that he's safe.

296
00:20:07,839 --> 00:20:08,480
Jiaojiao,

297
00:20:08,839 --> 00:20:10,200
Qi is really considerate.

298
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:12,000
He knows to tell her that he's safe.

299
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:13,400
Unlike someone else,

300
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,640
who's so talkative.

301
00:20:14,839 --> 00:20:15,920
You're the talkative one.

302
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:23,519
Sorry to keep you waiting.

303
00:20:29,519 --> 00:20:30,599
Finally, you're safe.

304
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:32,319
You were stuck in the escort agency.

305
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:33,640
I was so worried.

306
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:35,400
Did you run into any trouble?

307
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:36,720
Nothing at all.

308
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:41,799
Why aren't you eating?

309
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:47,079
Let's eat first.

310
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:50,960
Eat, eat, eat.

311
00:20:54,279 --> 00:20:55,240
Where's Cheng Qi?

312
00:20:56,319 --> 00:20:57,119
I don't know.

313
00:20:57,640 --> 00:21:00,000
I haven't seen him since the end of the handprint.

314
00:21:00,160 --> 00:21:00,720
It's really delicious.

315
00:21:03,759 --> 00:21:06,519
I heard he went to the Prime Minister's villa recently.

316
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:09,559
He must have asked Ms. Zhang for help.

317
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,160
Maybe.

318
00:21:16,359 --> 00:21:17,279
You guys eat first.

319
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:18,359
I'll be right back.

320
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:32,720
Who's there?

321
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:34,920
I'm Su Yuejiao.

322
00:21:35,440 --> 00:21:36,440
I'd like to know

323
00:21:36,599 --> 00:21:39,000
if my husband, Cheng Qi, is here.

324
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:40,200
Which Cheng Qi?

325
00:21:40,839 --> 00:21:42,400
The top of the Starry Clouds Conference.

326
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:43,240
He's not here.

327
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:46,160
But your lady invited him here before.

328
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:47,519
No visitors today.

329
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:48,960
Just leave.

330
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:27,960
Cheng Qi,

331
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:30,440
where have you been?

332
00:22:53,799 --> 00:22:54,759
She hasn't eaten anything today,

333
00:22:56,119 --> 00:22:57,160
only drank alcohol.

334
00:22:57,400 --> 00:22:58,960
She hasn't eaten anything else.

335
00:23:00,039 --> 00:23:00,640
I see.

336
00:23:01,240 --> 00:23:01,920
Keep serving her.

337
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:03,680
Don't miss any meal.

338
00:23:04,160 --> 00:23:05,119
Yes, My Lady.

339
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:21,000
I didn't expect you to be so untrustworthy.

340
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:30,599
If you refuse to enter officialdom,

341
00:23:30,880 --> 00:23:32,279
you'll never be the top poet.

342
00:23:32,839 --> 00:23:33,960
You chose this.

343
00:23:38,279 --> 00:23:39,680
To clear your agency's name,

344
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:41,640
you must be my man.

345
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:44,400
Otherwise, I can't ask my dad for help.

346
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:46,279
You chose this too.

347
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:53,319
To keep your talent from being wasted,

348
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:54,720
I let you write for me.

349
00:23:55,079 --> 00:23:56,279
Yet you're always down.

350
00:23:56,839 --> 00:23:58,400
No wonder your dad didn't like you.

351
00:24:06,119 --> 00:24:08,599
You know everything about me.

352
00:24:09,519 --> 00:24:10,920
I'm sure you know

353
00:24:12,119 --> 00:24:13,799
that I always need some

354
00:24:14,400 --> 00:24:16,839
beautiful girls,

355
00:24:17,039 --> 00:24:18,000
singing and dancing,

356
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:19,039
or I can't

357
00:24:20,240 --> 00:24:22,000
write anything good.

358
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:26,960
Do you do the same in the escort agency?

359
00:24:27,599 --> 00:24:28,680
I'm afraid you've forgotten

360
00:24:29,839 --> 00:24:30,920
that I used to write

361
00:24:31,519 --> 00:24:32,839
in Huayue Tower.

362
00:24:33,839 --> 00:24:36,480
So you want to listen to music?

363
00:24:37,839 --> 00:24:39,200
You must have

364
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:41,680
plenty of musicians and dancers.

365
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:46,720
Or

366
00:24:48,200 --> 00:24:50,400
do you have this hobby?

367
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:54,599
In that case,

368
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:58,079
I'll move the music house to your mansion.

369
00:25:04,839 --> 00:25:05,400
What?

370
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:07,079
The Sus were released?

371
00:25:07,240 --> 00:25:07,799
Yes.

372
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:08,920
It happened yesterday.

373
00:25:09,279 --> 00:25:12,000
It's said that it's the Grand Preceptor's idea.

374
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,079
What the Grand Preceptor's idea?

375
00:25:13,279 --> 00:25:14,599
It's Zhang Xi Yun's idea.

376
00:25:15,039 --> 00:25:17,240
She must have received some benefits from the Sus.

377
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:19,440
This two-faced woman.

378
00:25:19,839 --> 00:25:21,279
But she is the daughter of the Grand Preceptor.

379
00:25:21,279 --> 00:25:22,680
We can't do anything to her.

380
00:25:23,440 --> 00:25:24,400
She is untouchable.

381
00:25:24,880 --> 00:25:26,480
But the Sus are not scary.

382
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:27,799
Yes.

383
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:28,759
By the way,

384
00:25:29,279 --> 00:25:31,599
Have you arranged those people?

385
00:25:31,960 --> 00:25:32,799
Yes.

386
00:25:33,039 --> 00:25:33,960
They are all tight-lipped.

387
00:25:34,559 --> 00:25:35,839
If they are caught as bandits,

388
00:25:35,920 --> 00:25:37,200
they will say they are from Su's Escort Agency.

389
00:25:37,519 --> 00:25:38,920
I have given them the money for the jail.

390
00:25:39,359 --> 00:25:40,240
If they tell the truth,

391
00:25:40,440 --> 00:25:41,519
their families...

392
00:25:44,119 --> 00:25:46,880
We can't let the Su family rise again.

393
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:49,000
Pay attention to the escort in the city.

394
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:51,480
Don't let them take it back.

395
00:25:52,400 --> 00:25:53,880
You can trust me.

396
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:54,279
Get out!

397
00:25:55,440 --> 00:25:57,559
Guo Zheng, 21 years old,

398
00:25:57,799 --> 00:25:58,880
is an official.

399
00:25:59,119 --> 00:26:00,839
He's a good match for you.

400
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:02,200
Really? Thanks.

401
00:26:09,839 --> 00:26:10,400
Meng Feifei.

402
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:11,920
Is Cheng Yicheng here?

403
00:26:14,640 --> 00:26:15,720
What do you want from him?

404
00:26:17,240 --> 00:26:18,119
Cheng Qi is missing.

405
00:26:18,319 --> 00:26:19,599
I come here to take a chance.

406
00:26:19,839 --> 00:26:22,039
He didn't go back to the agency.

407
00:26:25,119 --> 00:26:26,119
He didn't get lost.

408
00:26:26,440 --> 00:26:27,599
And he didn't tell you where he was going.

409
00:26:28,319 --> 00:26:30,359
You should know where he might be.

410
00:26:31,559 --> 00:26:32,599
I went there before.

411
00:26:33,039 --> 00:26:34,279
They said he wasn't at the Grand Preceptor's Villa.

412
00:26:34,599 --> 00:26:36,359
We'll know if we go and see.

413
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:38,599
Let's go.

414
00:27:01,039 --> 00:27:02,839
I'm honored to perform for the royal family.

415
00:27:03,119 --> 00:27:05,039
I can finally make my father proud.

416
00:27:05,240 --> 00:27:07,119
Thank you for your help.

417
00:27:07,839 --> 00:27:08,799
This cup of wine,

418
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:09,960
I toast to you.

419
00:27:10,799 --> 00:27:12,759
Mr. Ling's talent is obvious to all,

420
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:15,960
and the speech for the royals will surely be well performed.

421
00:27:19,079 --> 00:27:20,119
I have heard that

422
00:27:20,720 --> 00:27:23,519
you are arranging a substitute writer for me.

423
00:27:24,039 --> 00:27:25,240
May I ask

424
00:27:25,559 --> 00:27:27,119
if you don't trust me?

425
00:27:29,079 --> 00:27:30,279
It's all my brother's idea.

426
00:27:30,799 --> 00:27:32,599
Don't get me wrong.

427
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:37,240
May I ask who will write the letter for me?

428
00:28:07,039 --> 00:28:09,920
Isn't this the new Star King, Mr Cheng?

429
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,279
Ms Zhang.

430
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:13,440
You're so arrogant.

431
00:28:13,839 --> 00:28:15,839
I can't believe you're working for someone.

432
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:18,319
Not at all.

433
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:21,319
I should thank Mr Ling for the opportunity.

434
00:28:22,039 --> 00:28:24,440
And Ms Zhang for understanding me.

435
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:27,240
I came to this Star Conference

436
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:30,839
just hoping to have a chance

437
00:28:31,119 --> 00:28:32,720
to enjoy myself in the capital.

438
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:35,759
Now I have both good wine and beautiful girls.

439
00:28:36,000 --> 00:28:38,039
Why should I be the champion?

440
00:28:39,680 --> 00:28:40,400
That's right.

441
00:28:41,119 --> 00:28:42,920
Even if a chicken flies to the top of a tree,

442
00:28:42,920 --> 00:28:44,039
it can't become a phoenix.

443
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:47,440
It's fine to make wild statements at the Xingyun Convention.

444
00:28:48,160 --> 00:28:50,880
But if you act improperly

445
00:28:51,039 --> 00:28:52,359
in the future...

446
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:53,640
Mr. Cheng,

447
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:55,400
you may be beheaded.

448
00:28:55,559 --> 00:28:56,640
Exactly.

449
00:28:57,079 --> 00:28:58,720
Instead of being so cautious,

450
00:28:58,720 --> 00:28:59,720
why not

451
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:01,039
live in the moment?

452
00:29:01,279 --> 00:29:02,400
Come, ladies,

453
00:29:03,079 --> 00:29:04,559
let's dance another round.

454
00:29:17,599 --> 00:29:18,640
He'll write the speech for you.

455
00:29:18,799 --> 00:29:20,400
Don't worry, Mr. Ling.

456
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:21,640
That's true.

457
00:29:22,759 --> 00:29:23,920
Thank you, Ms. Zhang.

458
00:29:59,079 --> 00:30:00,920
You danced so well.

459
00:30:01,640 --> 00:30:02,599
I'm glad you like it.

460
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:04,039
Let's go back and drink more.

461
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,880
Miss,

462
00:30:08,880 --> 00:30:10,000
do you want to go with me?

463
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:12,559
Maybe another day.

464
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:14,200
I have a beauty

465
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:16,160
to keep me company today.

466
00:30:18,039 --> 00:30:18,680
Cheng Qi,

467
00:30:22,839 --> 00:30:23,839
do you know me?

468
00:30:24,599 --> 00:30:25,599
Why don't you go home?

469
00:30:26,119 --> 00:30:27,039
It's fun here.

470
00:30:27,039 --> 00:30:28,440
This is my home.

471
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:35,319
Why are you here?

472
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:38,960
You left without a word that day.

473
00:30:39,799 --> 00:30:41,200
The whole family is worried about you.

474
00:30:41,240 --> 00:30:42,519
Why should I be worried?

475
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:43,799
You take care of your escort agency.

476
00:30:43,799 --> 00:30:44,799
I'll write my book.

477
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:45,680
Writing a book?

478
00:30:46,799 --> 00:30:48,799
Let Ling take the top spot on the Xingyun List.

479
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:50,240
and then write for him.

480
00:30:51,880 --> 00:30:52,880
What happened?

481
00:30:53,039 --> 00:30:53,799
Tell me!

482
00:30:55,079 --> 00:30:56,519
Why so many questions?

483
00:30:56,839 --> 00:30:58,720
This isn't a place for you. Leave.

484
00:30:58,720 --> 00:30:59,559
We'll leave together.

485
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:00,599
Mr. Su,

486
00:31:01,599 --> 00:31:03,319
this is the Grand Preceptor's villa,

487
00:31:04,880 --> 00:31:06,359
not some wilderness.

488
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:08,400
You can't just come and go

489
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:09,960
as you please.

490
00:31:12,319 --> 00:31:13,039
Miss Zhang,

491
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:15,160
I apologize for intruding

492
00:31:15,279 --> 00:31:16,279
on your estate today.

493
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:18,079
Please allow me to take Cheng Qi away.

494
00:31:18,319 --> 00:31:20,119
I will come to apologize another day.

495
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:23,519
Cheng Qi,

496
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:27,000
I thought you had made things clear with Mr. Su.

497
00:31:53,960 --> 00:31:55,839
It's all in black and white.

498
00:31:58,240 --> 00:31:59,079
I want a divorce.
